00:12:14.000 --> 00:12:37.000
published around the same time that did. One called travel guide, for instance. Travel guide listed where the NAACP chapters were in each city. They were much more attuned with civil rights, much more political tone. Eventually, the NAACP made it clear. And the NAACP said, what we're striving for, we're striving for integration.
在同一时期出版，它们确实采取了政治立场。例如，有一本叫《旅行指南》（Travel Guide）的刊物。它列出了每个城市NAACP分会的位置。它们更关注民权，政治色彩更浓。最终，NAACP明确表示了立场。NAACP说，我们所争取的是融合。

